orithmic corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§6.3, pp. 139–140; scans 147–148"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"efcd33b278c102f5\" href=\"?note=efcd33b278c102f5\" title=\"73-df-cyk-table\">73-df-cyk-table</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{G,w}\">\\(C_{G,w}\\)</span>。生成语言和推导见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall(i,j)\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;\\forall A\\in V\\;(A\\in C_{G,w}(i,j)\\leftrightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*w[i:j])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall(i,j)\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;\\forall A\\in V\\;(A\\in C_{G,w}(i,j)\\leftrightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*w[i:j])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nw\\in L(G)\\leftrightarrow[(n=0\\land(S,\\varepsilon)\\in P)\\lor\\exists(i,j)\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;(i=0\\land j=n\\land S\\in C_{G,w}(i,j))]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nw\\in L(G)\\leftrightarrow[(n=0\\land(S,\\varepsilon)\\in P)\\lor\\exists(i,j)\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;(i=0\\land j=n\\land S\\in C_{G,w}(i,j))]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对区间长度归纳：长度一只能用终结产生式；更长词的根规则为 A→BD，在某个非空分割位置 k 把两棵子树连接起来。由于 CNF 的开始符号不出现在右部，唯一空产生式不会参与非空子区间。对固定文法，检查 O(n²) 个格和每格 O(n) 个分点得到通常的立方时间实现；此代价说明是算法分析，未在断言中引入未定义的大 O。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cyk-table","status":"resolved","id":"efcd33b278c102f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cyk-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cyk-table","status":"resolved","id":"efcd33b278c102f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-cyk-table]] 的同一 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)$、$w$、$n$ 和 $C_{G,w}$。生成语言和推导见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-cyk-table]] 的同一 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)$、$w$、$n$ 和 $C_{G,w}$。生成语言和推导见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"C_{G,w}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm